# Experiment 014: L2 Chemical Level — Physics Becomes Informatics

Status: Layer 1 (core synthesis)

Date: 2025-07-13

## Thesis

The chemical level (L2) is where physics transitions into informatics.

Chemical reactions are computations that minimize energy.
Reaction networks are predictive systems without neurons.
Free energy of Gibbs is the first universal free energy of UAF, operational before life exists.

This level produces the largest surprise reduction per unit of description length
in the entire hierarchy from L-1 to L8.

---

