## 5. The deepest insight: chemistry is computation

In L2, every reaction is an inference step:

    Reactants (data) → Products (update) + Heat (prediction error)

The entire history of prebiotic chemistry on Earth is a 500-million-year
computation that minimized collective free energy of chemical systems,
eventually converging on the autocatalytic set that we call "life."

Life is not an accident.
Life is the attractor of chemical inference.

